Thus we only need transport_leg_assembled, origin_linked, destination_linked, loading_authorized. No need for leg loaded flags.

Thus we can use assemble_transport_leg (which requires origin_node_ready and destination_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, destination_availability_confirmed, and transport_leg_available). It does not require origin_node_occupied or destination_node_occupied. However goal requires origin_node_occupied and destination_node_occupied true. So we still need occupancy.

